WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.769
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.003
We hope you're doing well
tonight.

00:00:04.003 --> 00:00:05.504
And now we're going to get
to the news.

00:00:05.504 --> 00:00:08.374
President Biden spent the
weekend at his home in Delaware,

00:00:08.374 --> 00:00:10.709
but eventually,
the Secret Service found him

00:00:10.709 --> 00:00:12.145
and brought him back
to the White House.

00:00:12.145 --> 00:00:13.446
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:15.648
Republican Senator
Lindsey Graham

00:00:15.648 --> 00:00:17.149
called for the assassination

00:00:17.149 --> 00:00:18.951
of Russian President
Vladimir Putin

00:00:18.951 --> 00:00:21.654
during a Thursday-night
interview on Fox News.

00:00:21.654 --> 00:00:22.955
Say what you want about Lindsey.

00:00:22.955 --> 00:00:26.626
Pretty bold to do that
on Putin's own network.

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:28.895
[ Laughter ]

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:31.998
At an event over the weekend
for top Republican donors,

00:00:31.998 --> 00:00:34.600
former President Trump suggested
that the U.S.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:37.703
should paint the Chinese flag
on its fighter jets,

00:00:37.703 --> 00:00:39.939
bomb Russia,
and then added,

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:41.441
"They start fighting
with each other,

00:00:41.441 --> 00:00:43.843
and we sit back and watch."
Finally.

00:00:43.843 --> 00:00:45.344
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.344 --> 00:00:48.414
Finally, a way to bring
stability to the world --

00:00:48.414 --> 00:00:51.451
a war between Russia and China.

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:53.552
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.552 --> 00:00:56.489
Former Vice President Mike Pence
criticized Republicans

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:59.925
who have offered praise for
Russian President Vladimir Putin

00:00:59.925 --> 00:01:02.795
amid the invasion of Ukraine
and said, "There is no room

00:01:02.795 --> 00:01:05.498
in this party
for apologists for Putin,"

00:01:05.498 --> 00:01:08.668
quickly adding, "Sorry,
I meant no 'more' room.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:11.070
We're pretty -- We're just
super full right now."

00:01:11.070 --> 00:01:12.538
[ Laughter ]

00:01:12.538 --> 00:01:15.208
Netflix announced yesterday
it will temporarily discontinue

00:01:15.208 --> 00:01:17.410
its service in Russia,
in support of Ukraine.

00:01:17.410 --> 00:01:19.278
And in even harsher sanctions,

00:01:19.278 --> 00:01:21.381
Quibi announced
it will start up.

00:01:21.381 --> 00:01:24.317
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.686 --> 00:01:29.822
Visa and Mastercard on Saturday
suspended

00:01:29.822 --> 00:01:32.057
credit-card processing
operations in Russia.

00:01:32.057 --> 00:01:35.562
And despite that,
they still don't take Discover.

00:01:35.562 --> 00:01:37.696
[ Laughter ]

00:01:37.696 --> 00:01:39.098
In a new letter

00:01:39.098 --> 00:01:41.601
to "NBC Nightly News" anchor
Lester Holt,

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:43.069
former President Trump
complained

00:01:43.069 --> 00:01:45.004
about his ex-attorney general
William Barr,

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.973
and said Barr was
"groveling to the media,

00:01:46.973 --> 00:01:49.442
hoping to gain acceptance
that he doesn't deserve,"

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:52.945
which brings us to a new segment
entitled "Trump is Right."

00:01:52.945 --> 00:01:55.548
[ Theme music plays ]

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.483
Trump is...
[ Clears throat ]

00:01:57.483 --> 00:01:59.919
[ Laughter ]

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:01.120
[ Sighs sharply ]

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:02.221
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.221 --> 00:02:04.624
Just hold on.

00:02:04.624 --> 00:02:06.459
[ Laughter ]

00:02:06.459 --> 00:02:07.560
Trump is...

00:02:07.560 --> 00:02:09.028
[ Sighs ]

00:02:09.028 --> 00:02:10.529
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.529 --> 00:02:12.732
I can't do it.

00:02:12.732 --> 00:02:14.867
-This has been
"Trump is Right."

00:02:14.867 --> 00:02:16.969
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:16.969 --> 00:02:19.872
-The -- The
House select committee

00:02:19.872 --> 00:02:21.741
investigating the January attack
on the Capitol

00:02:21.741 --> 00:02:24.677
issued a subpoena last week
for Donald Trump Jr.'s fiancée,

00:02:24.677 --> 00:02:26.112
Kimberly Guilfoyle.

00:02:26.112 --> 00:02:28.414
The good news is,
she can do it from home.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.483
They can still hear her.

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:32.485
[ Laughter ]

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:34.587
New York Mayor Eric Adams
announced last week

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:36.890
that he is lifting
the city's vaccine requirement

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.391
for indoor entertainment venues,

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:41.694
and said, "This is truly
an Arnold Schwarzenegger moment.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:43.129
We'll be back."

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:45.431
Okay, but just
to refresh your memory,

00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:48.735
when he came back, he killed
like a ton of people.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.936
[ Light laughter ]

00:02:50.936 --> 00:02:54.040
[ Louder laughter ]

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:56.175
Guess we refreshed
everyone's memory.

00:02:56.175 --> 00:02:58.544
According to a new study,

00:02:58.544 --> 00:03:02.081
the top so-called unusual phobia
for New Jersey residents

00:03:02.081 --> 00:03:04.050
is the fear of long words,

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.620
which is just any word
longer than "Oh!"

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:10.756
[ Laughter ]

00:03:10.756 --> 00:03:14.093
Organizers of the Oscars
have announced

00:03:14.093 --> 00:03:16.195
Lady Gaga and Kevin Costner
will be presenters

00:03:16.195 --> 00:03:17.696
at this month's ceremony,

00:03:17.696 --> 00:03:20.466
so if you liked "Yellowstone"
and you liked "House of Gucci,"

00:03:20.466 --> 00:03:23.069
I'd love to meet you
and see what your deal is.

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.371
[ Laughter ]

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:28.608
And finally, today was
Alexander Graham Bell Day,

00:03:28.608 --> 00:03:30.243
which marks the anniversary
of the day

00:03:30.243 --> 00:03:32.912
he said those famous first words
into a telephone --

00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:34.947
"Representative?"

00:03:34.947 --> 00:03:37.984
[ Laughter ]

00:03:40.052 --> 00:03:43.122
When you got a closer.
[ Laughs ]

00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:44.990
And that was the monologue,
everybody.

00:03:44.990 --> 00:03:47.059
I, for the record --

00:03:47.059 --> 00:03:50.396
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:50.396 --> 00:03:53.866
I thought, uh...

00:03:53.866 --> 00:03:57.070
I-I thought "representative"
was gonna crush.

00:03:57.070 --> 00:03:58.337
I thought that was gonna be
a real,

00:03:58.337 --> 00:04:00.773
like, "standing ov" situation.

00:04:00.773 --> 00:04:02.742
Maybe that was it.

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:05.678
They could -- They could
sense my pride in it.

00:04:05.678 --> 00:04:08.581
They were like,
"No, no, no, no, no.

00:04:08.581 --> 00:04:10.717
You don't decide. We decide."

